menu "HubBLE OTA"
    config HUBBLE_SELFTEST_TIMEOUT_S
        int "Self-test deadline after boot (seconds)"
        default 60
        range 10 600
        help
            A freshly installed image must pass its self-test within this time, otherwise it is
            marked invalid and the bootloader returns to the previous image (CLAUDE.md §3.8).

    config HUBBLE_SELFTEST_FORCE_FAIL
        bool "Force the self-test to fail (rollback test builds only)"
        default n
        help
            Makes the self-test always fail so the automatic rollback can be verified on hardware
            (M1 hardware gate). NEVER enable in release builds.
endmenu
